## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of arguments).
Let e10 be 10000000000.
Let e15 be 1000000000000000.
Let base be (e15 * e15) + 7.
Let modulus be ((e10 * e10) * (e10 * e10)) + 9.
Let mutable acc be 0.
Let mutable t be 0.
Let mutable v be 0.
Let mutable i be 1.
While i is at most n:
    Set t to 0 - (base + i).
    Set v to 0 - t.
    Set acc to (acc + v) mod modulus.
    Set i to i + 1.
Show acc.
